      "text": "- Order writes ONCE and moves on\n- Each service reads at its own pace\n- Email down → it catches up later\n- New service → just start reading",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Order writes ONCE and moves on\n- Each service reads at its own pace\n- Email down → it catches up later\n- New service → just start reading",
