      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "gen": "kafka-notes"
      },
      "text": "- Each partition counts its own offsets from 0\n- Order is guaranteed ONLY inside one partition\n- Message address = (topic, partition, offset)\n- Reading does NOT delete messages\n- Retention (default 7 days) deletes old data\n- Partitions = unit of parallelism\n   (3 partitions → max 3 consumers per group)\n- You can add partitions later, never remove",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Each partition counts its own offsets from 0\n- Order is guaranteed ONLY inside one partition\n- Message address = (topic, partition, offset)\n- Reading does NOT delete messages\n- Retention (default 7 days) deletes old data\n- Partitions = unit of parallelism\n   (3 partitions → max 3 consumers per group)\n- You can add partitions later, never remove",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b1C"
    },
    {
