      "customData": {
        "gen": "kafka-notes"
      },
      "text": "- Same key → same partition → that key's events stay IN ORDER\n- Pick the key = the thing that needs ordering (orderID, userID)\n- No key → spread evenly, but no ordering\n- Hot partition: one very common key overloads one partition (and its consumer)\n- Adding partitions changes the key → partition mapping",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Same key → same partition → that key's events stay IN ORDER\n- Pick the key = the thing that needs ordering (orderID, userID)\n- No key → spread evenly, but no ordering\n- Hot partition: one very common key overloads one partition (and its consumer)\n- Adding partitions changes the key → partition mapping",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b1i"
    },
