      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1342773981,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 272519095,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793424485403,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "gen": "kafka-notes"
      },
      "text": "Rule 1: inside a group, each partition is read by\n            exactly ONE consumer (keeps order)\nRule 2: one consumer can own many partitions\nRule 3: more consumers than partitions → extras idle\nRule 4: groups are independent — each group gets\n            EVERY message, with its own bookmarks\n\nONE group, many consumers  =  QUEUE (share the work)\nMANY groups  =  PUB/SUB (broadcast)\n\nMax parallelism of a group = number of partitions",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Rule 1: inside a group, each partition is read by\n            exactly ONE consumer (keeps order)\nRule 2: one consumer can own many partitions\nRule 3: more consumers than partitions → extras idle\nRule 4: groups are independent — each group gets\n            EVERY message, with its own bookmarks\n\nONE group, many consumers  =  QUEUE (share the work)\nMANY groups  =  PUB/SUB (broadcast)\n\nMax parallelism of a group = number of partitions",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b28"
    },
