      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793424485403,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "gen": "kafka-notes"
      },
      "text": "- Commit = save the bookmark in Kafka\n   (internal topic __consumer_offsets)\n- The bookmark belongs to the GROUP, not the process\n- New group (no bookmark) → StartOffset\n   (kafka-go default: FirstOffset = from the start)\n- Lag keeps growing → consumers are too slow\n   → add consumers (up to the number of partitions)",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Commit = save the bookmark in Kafka\n   (internal topic __consumer_offsets)\n- The bookmark belongs to the GROUP, not the process\n- New group (no bookmark) → StartOffset\n   (kafka-go default: FirstOffset = from the start)\n- Lag keeps growing → consumers are too slow\n   → add consumers (up to the number of partitions)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b30"
    },
