      "updated": 1793424485403,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "gen": "kafka-notes"
      },
      "text": "Stores cluster metadata: live brokers,\nwho leads each partition, ISR, configs.\nBrokers send heartbeats to C1.\nC1 was elected by majority vote (Raft).\nIf C1 dies, C2/C3 elect a new active one.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Stores cluster metadata: live brokers,\nwho leads each partition, ISR, configs.\nBrokers send heartbeats to C1.\nC1 was elected by majority vote (Raft).\nIf C1 dies, C2/C3 elect a new active one.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "eCaQ90l5UkysaCZKRwKm",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1380,
      "y": 2245,
      "width": 882.7500000000001,
      "height": 18.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "BH0HURByDwcMRwC8aReH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1006821489,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 182625948,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793424485403,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "gen": "kafka-notes"
      },
      "text": "Each partition has 3 copies on 3 different brokers. Leaders are spread out so every broker shares the work.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Each partition has 3 copies on 3 different brokers. Leaders are spread out so every broker shares the work.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3a"
    },
