      "text": "ISR (in-sync replicas) = {Broker 1, 2, 3}",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "ISR (in-sync replicas) = {Broker 1, 2, 3}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3t"
    },
    {
      "id": "6mL7fLltLwDwXSBU37e1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2260,
      "y": 2340,
      "width": 420.75000000000006,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": "BH0HURByDwcMRwC8aReH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1040489791,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 685599774,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1793424485403,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "gen": "kafka-notes"
      },
      "text": "- Producers & consumers talk to the LEADER\n- Followers keep pulling (copying) from the leader\n- ISR = copies that are fully caught up\n- acks=all → ack only after every ISR copy has it\n- min.insync.replicas=2 → writes allowed only while\n   at least 2 copies are in sync\n- Leader dies → controller makes an ISR follower\n   the new leader (automatic, a few seconds)",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Producers & consumers talk to the LEADER\n- Followers keep pulling (copying) from the leader\n- ISR = copies that are fully caught up\n- acks=all → ack only after every ISR copy has it\n- min.insync.replicas=2 → writes allowed only while\n   at least 2 copies are in sync\n- Leader dies → controller makes an ISR follower\n   the new leader (automatic, a few seconds)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b3u"
    },
